FluxPlayer legacy HEVC FLV read compatibility for Windows FFmpeg
Base: 5a1f107b4c78318f318897900acad1b6c6aa3f9d (n7.1.3-43-g5a1f107b4c)

Add private codec-id 12 without changing upstream Enhanced FLV hvc1 handling.
Legacy tags contain a packet-type byte and signed 24-bit CTS for sequence,
coded and end packets. Skip end/unknown packets instead of decoding them.
Upstream files retain their LGPL-2.1-or-later license.

